{"2668530": {"success": true, "data": {"type": "game", "name": "The Rake", "steam_appid": 2668530, "required_age": 0, "is_free": false, "controller_support": "full", "dlc": [3099440, 3099480, 4101330], "detailed_description": "<h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Overview:</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Open-world  survival horror game where you have to hunt down and kill the urban legend &quot;<strong>The Rake</strong>&quot; alone or in 2-4 Player <strong>Multiplayer</strong>. You can use guns, melee weapons, beartraps, a handheld motion sensor, gun attachments, trail-cams, medical equipment, food, and anything else you can find to survive, defend yourself, and win against The Rake  while exploring or doing quests in the detailed and realistic open world. </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Features:</strong></h2><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ></h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > <strong>Singleplayer &amp; 2-4 Player Online Multiplayer (Beta)</strong></p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>2 Full Campaigns including Hells Valley Nation Park &amp; Rake 2015 Map Remake</strong></p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Detailed Open-World with Locations filled with Lore &amp; Loot</strong></p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Original Soundtrack</strong></p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Wide Variety of Melee Weapons &amp; Guns like ARs, Pistols, Shotguns, SMGs, &amp; More </strong></p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Equipment like Night Vision, Drones, Handheld Motion Sensors, Weapon Attachments, Deployable Beartraps, Cameras, &amp; More</strong></p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Dynamic Day/Night Cycle with Dynamic Weather, Volumetric Clouds &amp; Fog, Visual Effects, &amp; Sounds with over 15 different weather variants including blizzards, thunderstorms, hurricanes, light snow, heavy fog, dust storms, and more</strong></p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Multiplayer Features:</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>2-4 Player Online CO-OP</strong></p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Text &amp; Voice Chat with TTS</strong></p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Both Campaigns Fully Playable</strong></p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Main Quest Support</strong></p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Rake Health Scaling Depending on Players</strong></p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Lan &amp; Private Lobbies</strong></p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Steam Invites</strong></p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><i>(Multiplayer is in Beta, some features like the drone and cameras are disabled and are only accessible in singleplayer)</i></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Lore:</strong> </h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The main campaign takes place in Hells Valley National Park in Pennsylvania, which has been closed off to the public for years due to dozens of murders and unexplained disappearances. You have been invited by your friend to help him hunt The Rake after years of tracking down its home. You arrive only to find a blood stain, flashlight, and a frantically written note. This is where the main quest picks up, which revolves around going from location to location searching for your friend while completing mini-objectives and having to defend yourself from The Rake along the way. The main quest is non-linear so you can complete any quest at anytime, it's also completely optional so if you want to just explore the map and kill the rake you can do that too. The second campaign (Rake 2015 Map Remake) Takes place two months after continues the story.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>No AI Used In Development/Marketing:</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >No AI was used in any part of the development/marketing of the game by me or any team members. Everything that goes into the game that was made by somebody else is checked by me to make sure its 100% made by a real person every step of the way. </p>", "about_the_game": "<h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Overview:</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Open-world  survival horror game where you have to hunt down and kill the urban legend &quot;<strong>The Rake</strong>&quot; alone or in 2-4 Player <strong>Multiplayer</strong>. You can use guns, melee weapons, beartraps, a handheld motion sensor, gun attachments, trail-cams, medical equipment, food, and anything else you can find to survive, defend yourself, and win against The Rake  while exploring or doing quests in the detailed and realistic open world. </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Features:</strong></h2><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ></h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > <strong>Singleplayer &amp; 2-4 Player Online Multiplayer (Beta)</strong></p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>2 Full Campaigns including Hells Valley Nation Park &amp; Rake 2015 Map Remake</strong></p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Detailed Open-World with Locations filled with Lore &amp; Loot</strong></p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Original Soundtrack</strong></p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Wide Variety of Melee Weapons &amp; Guns like ARs, Pistols, Shotguns, SMGs, &amp; More </strong></p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Equipment like Night Vision, Drones, Handheld Motion Sensors, Weapon Attachments, Deployable Beartraps, Cameras, &amp; More</strong></p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Dynamic Day/Night Cycle with Dynamic Weather, Volumetric Clouds &amp; Fog, Visual Effects, &amp; Sounds with over 15 different weather variants including blizzards, thunderstorms, hurricanes, light snow, heavy fog, dust storms, and more</strong></p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Multiplayer Features:</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>2-4 Player Online CO-OP</strong></p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Text &amp; Voice Chat with TTS</strong></p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Both Campaigns Fully Playable</strong></p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Main Quest Support</strong></p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Rake Health Scaling Depending on Players</strong></p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Lan &amp; Private Lobbies</strong></p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Steam Invites</strong></p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><i>(Multiplayer is in Beta, some features like the drone and cameras are disabled and are only accessible in singleplayer)</i></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Lore:</strong> </h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The main campaign takes place in Hells Valley National Park in Pennsylvania, which has been closed off to the public for years due to dozens of murders and unexplained disappearances. You have been invited by your friend to help him hunt The Rake after years of tracking down its home. You arrive only to find a blood stain, flashlight, and a frantically written note. This is where the main quest picks up, which revolves around going from location to location searching for your friend while completing mini-objectives and having to defend yourself from The Rake along the way. The main quest is non-linear so you can complete any quest at anytime, it's also completely optional so if you want to just explore the map and kill the rake you can do that too. The second campaign (Rake 2015 Map Remake) Takes place two months after continues the story.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>No AI Used In Development/Marketing:</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >No AI was used in any part of the development/marketing of the game by me or any team members. Everything that goes into the game that was made by somebody else is checked by me to make sure its 100% made by a real person every step of the way. </p>", "short_description": "Hunt The Rake in Singleplayer or 2-4 Player Multiplayer using Pistols, Beartraps, SMGs, ARs, Shotguns, Motion Sensors, Trail Cams, and whatever else you can find to survive The Rake while exploring and completing quests in the 2 Campaigns/Maps included (Hells Valley &amp; 2015 Map Remake)", "supported_languages": "English<strong>*</strong><br><strong>*</strong>languages with full audio support", "header_image": "https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2668530/00df56c4b857f667cff6d75a4a1af5f83833523e/header_alt_assets_2.jpg?t=1784320869", "capsule_image": "https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2668530/d93ceea36c5103a6767d1c77ed21f3bf4a3ecc95/capsule_231x87_alt_assets_2.jpg?t=1784320869", "capsule_imagev5": "https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2668530/d93ceea36c5103a6767d1c77ed21f3bf4a3ecc95/capsule_184x69_alt_assets_2.jpg?t=1784320869", "website": "https://kanoleiro.my.canva.site/", "pc_requirements": {"minimum": "<strong>Minimum:</strong><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li>Requires a 64-bit processor a